    <string name="saipen_gestures_pen">Pen</string>
    <string name="saipen_gestures_reset">Back to standard</string>
    <string name="saipen_gestures_edge_note">Swipes from the edge work in the middle of each side: Android keeps the rest for its Back gesture.</string>
    <string name="saipen_gestures_air_note">The button in the air: if your tablet opens its own pen menu instead, turn that off in the tablet\'s pen settings.</string>
    <string name="saipen_gestures_bluetooth_note">A Bluetooth S Pen (one with Air actions in Samsung\'s S Pen settings, like the Galaxy S24 Ultra\'s): held farther from the screen, where the cursor no longer follows it, one press of its button undoes and two presses redo. Turn SAI Pen on in Settings, Advanced features, S Pen, Air actions, under App actions: Samsung leaves it off. Near the screen the button does what is chosen above.</string>
